OL,3,CCrowds gather for Belfast Pride parade
OL,5,FCrowds gathered in Belfast on Saturday
OL,6,Fafternoon as the Pride parade made its
OL,7,Fway through city centre.
OL,9,F'Love in every colour' was the theme
OL,10,Fof this year's Belfast Pride festival.
OL,12,FAnd every colour was on display at the
OL,13,Fparade, as the celebrations got
OL,14,Funderway in the city centre.
OL,16,FAlexa Moore from the Rainbow Project
OL,17,Fsaid: "Our message for this year is
OL,18,Fthat Northern Ireland is no place for
OL,19,Fhate.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/3
