OL,3,CCrowds gather for Belfast Pride parade
OL,5,F"What we saw earlier in the summer in
OL,6,Fterms of the racist violence that
OL,7,Fswept across our city, and what we see
OL,8,Fevery single day for the violence our
OL,9,FLGBT communities experience,
OL,10,Fparticularly ethnic minority LGBT
OL,11,Fpeople who experience massive rates of
OL,12,Fviolence in Northern Ireland."
OL,14,FThis is the 35th anniversary of the
OL,15,Ffirst Pride parade in Belfast.
OL,17,FAround a hundred people turned up that
OL,18,Fday - now, it's an event where tens of
OL,19,Fthousands attend.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/3
